        "\\(1 - e^{-10}\\)",
        "\\(1 - e^{10}\\)"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "ma8",
      "type": "MCQ",
      "marks": 2,
      "negativeMarks": 0.67,
      "text": "Fixed-point iteration \\(x_{n+1}=3+(x_n-3)^{3}\\) with \\(x_0=3.25\\). The order of convergence is:",
      "options": [
